    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0627/tlg046/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0627.tlg046.13",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "13. Δυνάμιος δὲ ποικίλαι φύσιες.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0627/tlg046/1st1K-grc1#tlg0627.tlg046.14",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0627/tlg046/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0627.tlg046.14",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "14. Χυλοὶ φθείροντες καὶ ὅλον καὶ μέρος καὶ ἔξωθεν καὶ ἔνδοθεν, αὐτόματοι καὶ οὐκ αὐτόματοι, ἡμῖν μὲν αὐτόματοι, αἰτίῃ δ’ οὐκ αὐτόματοι· αἰτίης δὲ τὰ μὲν δῆλα, τὰ δ’ ἄδηλα, καὶ τὰ μὲν δυνατὰ, τὰ δ’ ἀδύνατα.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0627/tlg046/1st1K-grc1#tlg0627.tlg046.15",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0627/tlg046/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0627.tlg046.15",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "15. Φύσις ἐξαρκέει πάντα πᾶσιν.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
